# BEGIN aydinnyunus-sleep-nightly
# One unattended pass a day at 03:41. Report-only: `nightly` runs the gated
# consolidation (T0 -> T1 candidates) and, once a week, a replay report.
# Neither half can write T2, so nothing unattended can reach a session as a
# directive. Promotion stays a human running `sleepctl promote`.
# Install via: python3 tools/install.py --nightly
# Manual:        crontab -e  then paste the line below.
# After editing: crontab -l | grep aydinnyunus
# Remove:        python3 tools/uninstall.py
__SLEEP_CRON__
# END aydinnyunus-sleep-nightly
